{"n":8,"title":"My place (no filter)","blurb":"By the end you can say where you live and what's in your home with there is / there are.","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Quick recall from Lesson 7. Choose, then check.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"an"},{"label":"a"},{"label":"— (nothing)"},{"label":"a"},{"label":"an"},{"label":"— (nothing)"},{"label":"Japan"},{"label":"the Japan"},{"label":"an"},{"label":"an"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Live","pos":"","ru":"жить","kk":"тұру","def":"to have your home in a place: I live in Astana","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-live.jpg"},{"en":"House, flat","pos":"","ru":"дом, квартира","kk":"үй, пәтер","def":"two homes: a building, or rooms in a big building","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-house-flat.jpg"},{"en":"Room, bedroom, bathroom","pos":"","ru":"комната, спальня, ванная","kk":"бөлме, жатын бөлме, жуынатын бөлме","def":"parts of a home: for sleeping and for washing","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-room-bedroom-bathroom.jpg"},{"en":"Kitchen, living room, garden","pos":"","ru":"кухня, гостиная, сад","kk":"ас үй, қонақ бөлме, бақ","def":"where you cook, where you relax, and the green place outside","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-kitchen-living-room-garden.jpg"},{"en":"City, town, village","pos":"","ru":"город, городок, деревня","kk":"қала, қалашық, ауыл","def":"places where people live: very big, smaller, and small","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-city-town-village.jpg"},{"en":"Street","pos":"","ru":"улица","kk":"көше","def":"the road with houses in a city or town","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-street.jpg"},{"en":"Lift, floor, toilet, exit","pos":"","ru":"лифт, этаж, туалет, выход","kk":"лифт, қабат, дәретхана, шығу","def":"useful words inside a building","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-lift-floor-toilet-exit.jpg"},{"en":"Near, next to, upstairs, over there","pos":"","ru":"рядом, возле, наверху, вон там","kk":"жақын, қасында, жоғ